   </description>
   <indicator measure="1">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output 1  Indicator 1</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output: Improved system planning and project management capacities in DABS 
Indicator: At least 10 DABS management and technical personnel (M/F) are trained to manage DABS in 2016. (baseline: 0) 
Progress/Status: ADB financed consultants SMEC International,  Byucksan International, Hill International and Fichtner GmbH has closely worked with DABS to design, implement and supervise sub-projects under tranches 1 (G-0134) T2 (G-0184), T3, T4 and T5. Meanwhile, USAID, ADB and WB have parallel programs complementing efforts towards capacity building and institutional strengthening of DABS in particular and energy sector in general. 
Data Source: DABS training report 
Actual value:</narrative>
    </description>
