    </period>
   </indicator>
   <indicator measure="1">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output 2  Indicator 1</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output: Kabul Distribution Network in Darchi-e-Bashi (South West Kabul) developed 
Indicator: New 400 kms of low-voltage (LV-0.4 kV) lines by 2016. (baseline: 0) 
Progress/Status: The Contract was awarded to FEKA (Turkey) on 23 September 2013. The design works  commenced in March 2014 and construction/installation is 100% completed and handed over to EA in Q1 2018. 
Data Source: ICE quarterly report
DABS annual report 
Actual value:</narrative>
    </description>
    <baseline value="0" year="2009"></baseline>
    <period>
