    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output: Improved system planning and project management capacities in DABS 
Indicator: DABS revolving fund established and put into operation by 2016. (baseline: 0) 
Progress/Status: Due to cost overruns in the 3 physical sub-projects under the tranche, DABS have formally requested  ADB to cancel remaining sub-projects (i) DABS senior management assistance, and (ii) support for distribution planning and (iii) revolving fund as these jobs are being funded by the United States Government. 
Data Source: DABS annual report 
